  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Minority Rights in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project addresses rising cases of abuse, discrimination and violence based on myths linked to albinism, witchcraft and sexual orientation and/or gender identity. The project builds on previous efforts informed by lessons from the previous programme including the end-of-term evaluation and recommendations. The project focuses on addressing structural causes of these human rights violations by, among others, curbing myths, misconceptions and harmful cultural practices that expose the three targeted minority groups to the risk of discrimination and violence.</narrative>
  </description>
